#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:41
msgid "a. A standard passcode is set for all Malaysian IPS for this year’s Hajj"
msgstr "a. 为今年朝觐（Hajj）的所有马来西亚 IPS 设置统一的标准通行码"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:73
msgid "a. COSE message is extracted from the CWT. b. COSE signature is verified using Malaysia’s public key from the GDHCN public registry. Malaysia’s country code is “MY”"
msgstr "a. 从 CWT 中提取 COSE 消息。b. 使用 GDHCN 公共登记库中马来西亚的公钥验证 COSE 签名。马来西亚的国家代码为“MY”"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:59
msgid "a. COSE message is wrapped into a CBOR Web Token (CWT)."
msgstr "a. 将 COSE 消息封装为 CBOR Web 令牌（CWT）。"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:63
msgid "a. CWT is base64 encoded and converted into a QR code"
msgstr "a. 对 CWT 进行 base64 编码并转换为二维码（QR code）"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:88
msgid "a. GET request is made for the IPS in the preferred file type (PDF). b. IPS JSON file is decrypted using the encryption key from the HCert response."
msgstr "a. 以首选文件类型（PDF）发出获取 IPS 的 GET 请求。b. 使用 HCert 响应中的加密密钥解密 IPS JSON 文件。"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:78
msgid "a. HCert is decoded from base64. b. VHL JSON is extracted from the HCert payload."
msgstr "a. 对 HCert 进行 base64 解码。b. 从 HCert 载荷中提取 VHL JSON。"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:55
msgid "a. HCert is inserted into the COSE message, signed with GDHCN key, and the Key ID (KID) is added to the header."
msgstr "a. 将 HCert 插入 COSE 消息，使用 GDHCN 密钥签名，并在头部中添加密钥 ID（KID）。"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:93
msgid "a. IPS PDF file is downloaded and saved for further use by healthcare workers."
msgstr "a. 下载并保存 IPS PDF 文件，供卫生工作者后续使用。"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:83
msgid "a. POST request is sent to the VHL manifest URL to retrieve the base64 encoded VHL manifest JSON. b. VHL manifest JSON is decoded from base64."
msgstr "a. 向 VHL 清单 URL 发送 POST 请求，以检索 base64 编码的 VHL 清单 JSON。b. 对 VHL 清单 JSON 进行 base64 解码。"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:69
msgid "a. QR code is scanned and the base64 encoded CWT is obtained."
msgstr "a. 扫描二维码（QR code），获得 base64 编码的 CWT。"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:35
msgid "a. Users provide consent to generate the Health Certificate QR code."
msgstr "a. 用户同意生成健康证书二维码（QR code）。"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:47
msgid "a. VHL is created as a manifest URL based on user preferences and supports JSON and PDF content types."
msgstr "a. 根据用户偏好将 VHL 创建为清单 URL，支持 JSON 和 PDF 内容类型。"

#: input/pagecontent/reference-implementations-malaysia.md:51
msgid "a. VHL is embedded into a Health Certificate (HCert) following WHO's smart trust specification."
msgstr "a. 按照世卫组织（WHO）的 smart trust 规范，将 VHL 嵌入健康证书（HCert）中。"

